    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/472625cd-4ca1-468c-9b33-c499048ebf27.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.42014in;height:1.64028in\" /><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> { <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∵</mo></math> both curves are symmetric about line <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> }<br />Then,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><